italic>: <italic>P</italic>&#x0003c;0.001.</p></caption><graphic xmlns:xlink="http://www.w3.org/1999/xlink" mime-subtype="jpeg" xlink:href="92-6602568f2"/></fig><fig id="fig3"><label>Figure 3</label><caption><p>Real-time PCR of 11<italic>&#x003b2;</italic>HSD-1 in HOSE, SKOV-3, BG-1, PEO-4 and PEO-14 cells treated with increasing concentrations of IL-1<italic>&#x003b1;</italic>. Level of mRNA was standardised to 18S using an internal control and normalised to untreated cells. Data (<italic>n</italic>=6) are presented as mean&#x000b1;s.e.m. Letters denote significance above control: <italic>a</italic>: <italic>P</italic>&#x0003c;0.05 and <italic>b</italic>: <italic>P</italic>&#x0003c;0.01.</p></caption><graphic xmlns:xlink="http://www.w3.org/1999/xlink" mime-subtype="jpeg" xlink:href="92-6602568f3"/></fig><fig id="fig4"><label>Figure 4</label><caption><p>Real-time PCR of 11<italic>&#x003b2;</italic>HSD-2 in HOSE, SKOV-3, BG-1, PEO-4 and PEO-14 cells treated with increasing concentrations of IL-1<italic>&#x003b1;</italic>. Level of mRNA was standardised to 18S using an internal control and normalised to untreated cells. Data (<italic>n</italic>=6) are presented as mean&#x000b1;s.e.m. Letters denote significance above control: <italic>a</italic>: <italic>P</italic>&#x0003c;0.05 and <italic>b</italic>: <italic>P</italic>&#x0003c;0.001, and below control: <italic>c</italic>: <italic>P</italic>&#x0003c;0.05 and <italic>d</italic>: <italic>P</italic>&#x0003c;0.01.</p></caption><graphic xmlns:xlink="http://www.w3.org/1999/xlink" mime-subtype="jpeg" xlink:href="92-6602568f4"/></fig><fig id="fig5"><label>Figure 5</label><caption><p>Real-time PCR of COX-2 in HOSE, SKOV-3, BG-1, PEO-4 and PEO-14 cells treated with increasing concentrations of IL-1<italic>&#x003b1;</italic>. Level of mRNA was standardised to 18S using an internal control and normalised to untreated cells. Data (<italic>n</italic>=6) are presented as mean&#x000b1;s.e.m. Letters denote significance above control: <italic>a</italic>: <italic>P</italic>&#x0003c;0.05, <italic>b</italic>: <italic>P</italic>&#x0003c;0.01 and <italic>c</italic>: <italic>P</italic>&#x0003c;0.001.</p></caption><graphic xmlns:xlink="http://www.w3.org/1999/xlink" mime-subtype="jpeg" xlink:href="92-6602568f5"/></fig></floats-wrap></article>